#### 2.2.3 The administration of ANT task

```
When performing the ANT task (Fan et al., 2002; Figure 2A),
participants were seated with their chin secured using a chinrest
apparatus (Figure 2B).
Stimuli were presented using a custom program developed
with Psychtoolbox^1 and participants’ behavioral responses were
```
```
